+-- stained-glass lozenge, fitted upper sleeves, a violet sash and a bustle with
+-- its bow at the waist, a wide peplum, and a small amber lantern hung at the
+-- left hip. The upper skirt hangs from each thigh in wide panels, joined at
+-- the front by a violet orphrey, and steps out at the hip so the gown reads as
+-- a bell from the high camera. FloodchoirHem carries it on down the shins.
